From f0b2d66e93ae5c127ecf2df5b294ca389963730b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PhialsBasement <PhialsBasement@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 1 Jun 2026 07:26:57 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] msvcrt: Avoid NULL dereference in _FindAndUnlinkFrame on an
 empty frame list.

When frame_info_head is NULL and the frame being unlinked is not the head,
the lookup loop dereferenced NULL via cur->next. Guard the loop so it falls
through to the existing not-found path.
---
 dlls/msvcrt/except.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dlls/msvcrt/except.c b/dlls/msvcrt/except.c
index 8be9ab7..3ebdcdb 100644
--- a/dlls/msvcrt/except.c
+++ b/dlls/msvcrt/except.c
@@ -919,7 +919,7 @@ void CDECL _FindAndUnlinkFrame(frame_info *fi)
         return;
     }
 
-    for (; cur->next; cur = cur->next)
+    for (; cur && cur->next; cur = cur->next)
     {
         if (cur->next == fi)
         {
-- 
2.56.0

